    The average 40-yard dash for a 17-year-old male is 5.0 to 5.4 seconds. For females it is 5.6 to 6.2 seconds. Junior year is the primary recruiting evaluation window — here is exactly what counts as average, good, and elite, what college scouts are actually looking for at 17, and how much ground you can still gain before your senior season.
